                  "content": "关键需求标注",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "lbknc",
                  "name": "dbNoteWrap",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#F7F7F7",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": 16,
                  "gap": 10,
                  "cornerRadius": 6,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ObqdH",
                      "name": "dbNote0",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "1. 数据来源：全部取自 metric_buckets 指标桶，禁止在查询时对 decisions 全表聚合（AD-03）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "eCRp6",
                      "name": "dbNote1",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "2. 实时事件流走 SSE（GET /api/v1/metrics/stream），页面断开后需自动重连。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "2IaI9",
                      "name": "dbNote2",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "3. 「预估挽回资损」= Σ 被 reject 的订单金额，单位为分、展示转元；口径属悬空点 G-09，待确认。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "7gVZ7",
                      "name": "dbNote3",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "4. 所有卡片需支持点击下钻：点「待审案件数」跳转审核工作台并带上 status=pending 筛选。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "dDrKJ",
                      "name": "dbNote4",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "5. 时间范围切换需同步刷新全部 4 张卡片 + 3 张图表，不能只刷局部。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
